OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's happening to Hanley's      
OL,4,AWinter Wonderland?                     
OL,6,FIt's the festive treat that families   
OL,7,Fflock to, but questions are being asked
OL,8,Fabout what is happening to Hanley's    
OL,9,FWinter Wonderland this year.           
OL,11,FAccording to the event website, the    
OL,12,F"enchanting playground" will return    
OL,13,Ffrom 26 November, but the booking links
OL,14,Fto "secure your magical visit" do not  
OL,15,Fwork.                                  
OL,17,FBirch Terrace car park, where it has   
OL,18,Fbeen held since 2016, currently stands 
OL,19,Fempty. There are no twinkling lights or
OL,20,Ffairground rides, and the Christmas    
OL,21,Fchalets have yet to be set up.         
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
