OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's happening to Hanley's      
OL,4,AWinter Wonderland?                     
OL,6,FStoke-on-Trent City Council has ruled  
OL,7,Fout the event taking place outside of  
OL,8,FHanley but has not confirmed if it will
OL,9,Fgo ahead. Event organiser, Michelle    
OL,10,FMatthews, told the BBC she was still   
OL,11,F"waiting for answers".                 
